{"id":"tumeur","lemma":"tumeur","pos":"noun","rank":2774,"glosses":["tumor"],"ipa":"/ty.mœʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8a/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-tumeur.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-tumeur.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"tumeurs"},"examples":[{"text":"La tumeur était bénigne.","en":"The tumor was benign.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1103029","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"benign","l":"bénin"}]},{"text":"J'ai une tumeur cérébrale.","en":"I have a brain tumor.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"cerebral","l":"cérébral"}]},{"text":"La tumeur s'avéra bénigne.","en":"The tumor proved to be benign.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"to uncover, to reveal","l":"avérer"},{"g":"benign","l":"bénin"}]},{"text":"J'ai eu une tumeur de l'estomac et j'ai dû la faire opérer.","en":"I got a stomach tumor and had to have it operated on.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"stomach"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},null,null,{"g":"to operate"}],"phrases":[[12,14,"to fool"]]}]}